  npcName: Black Bear
  npcPortrait: {fileID: -2063535435, guid: 2277d390f85784b4886058b001cd41e9, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - You may wanna do some pushups, tug-of-war contest is coming up next week... as
    long as you have me on your team you'll be fine!
  - Oh yeah, Scout Master told me I get to putcha to work! You know, since I know
    this place like the back of my paw... ha!
  - 'You can find sticks and stones needed for the campfire in the meadow just east
    of here. '
  - Woah, you did that pretty fast! I might need to up my game... Go bring everything
    to Scout Master so we can build that fire!
